The panel, the OpenVR overlay, and the idea of the in-app updater are adapted
from Frame Mic Tuner by sasaken1102r, which is MIT licensed:
https://github.com/sasaken1102r/frame-mic-tuner

The "Frame apps by sasaken@" list (src/apps/) is a Rust port of that project's
frame-apps 0.3.1 catalog, including the other apps' icons. Those icons are MIT,
the same as Frame Mic Tuner.

The panel glyphs are embedded copies of Iconify icons. Nothing is downloaded
